# WebSockets

- Requires ASGI + Redis channel layer (`config/settings/channels.py`).
- Routes: `{{cookiecutter.project_slug}}/core/routing.py` → `websocket_urlpatterns`.
- Authenticate before joining groups; keep consumers thin — business rules in services.
- Do not mix WS auth casually with HTTP auth helpers without reading existing patterns.

